A voice AI assistant deployed in pharmaceutical manufacturing that uses specialised language models to provide location-aware responses about plant operations.

The system processes acoustic input in noisy factory environments and integrates with manufacturing execution systems, delivering a 70% reduction in time spent searching for procedural documentation, with 85% of queries resolved without human intervention.

*Note : The project is under NDA and no further details about the technical optimisations and fine-tuning can be shared.*
